On Mon, 6 Nov 2006, Rast wrote:

> The dev/null trophies information page doesn't mention any "Best In
> Show" points for runners-up to the Grand, Major, and Minor trophies.
> But it seems to me that some points are being given for those, based on
> scoreboard fluctuations.  Could that information be added to the page?

While we are at the topic of scoring: There seem to be some general
problems with the logfile; some entries are present multiple times. A
comparison with the output from "sort -u" suggests that several hundred
deaths are entered multiple times.

If the scripts parsing the logfile do not take this into account, this can
have an impact on the best-of-13 trophy and the "bells on"-modifier. It
also might account for strange fluctuations in clan points, if the number
of games is taken into account there.

